{"version":1,"content":"<html><body>\n<p>Swisse Ultivite女性多元維他命120片裝（Swisse Ultivite Women’s Multivitamin）邊度買平？新假期整理屈臣氏、Market Place及龍豐共3間零售商的網店報價。以同款單瓶標價計，最低與次低相差HK$201，約54%。</p>\n<h2>Swisse Ultivite女性多元維他命120片裝各網店報價</h2>\n<table>\n<thead></thead>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th><strong>零售商</strong></th>\n<th><strong>單瓶標價</strong></th>\n<th><strong>單瓶總額</strong></th>\n<th><strong>計價條件</strong></th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>最低已核實｜龍豐</strong></td>\n<td><strong>HK$168</strong></td>\n<td><strong>HK$168</strong></td>\n<td><strong>單瓶標價</strong></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>屈臣氏</td>\n<td>HK$369</td>\n<td>HK$369</td>\n<td>單瓶標價</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Market Place</td>\n<td>HK$381</td>\n<td>HK$381</td>\n<td>單瓶標價</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<h2>Swisse Ultivite女性多元維他命120片裝單瓶價錢點計？</h2>\n<p>買一瓶，龍豐的同款網上標價為HK$168，較表列次低標價HK$369少HK$201。這個價差以單瓶商品標價比較。若打算買多件，宜另計商戶的購買條件及結帳價。</p>\n<p>以上為2026年11月13日商戶網上報價，未計運費，價格、優惠及供應以商戶為準。網店來源：<a href=\"https://www.watsons.com.hk/zh-hk/swisse-swisse-ultivite-%E5%A5%B3%E6%80%A7%E5%A4%9A%E5%85%83%E7%B6%AD%E4%BB%96%E5%91%BD-120%E7%89%87/p/BP_293455\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">屈臣氏</a><a href=\"https://www.marketplacehk.com/zh-hant/wellcome/p/Swisse%E5%A5%B3%E6%80%A7%E6%B4%BB%E5%8A%9B%E8%A4%87%E5%90%88%E7%B6%AD%E4%BB%96%E5%91%BD%20120PC/i/101357796.html\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Market Place</a><a href=\"https://eshop.lungfung.hk/product/mdn220304/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">龍豐</a></p>\n<p>香港品牌頁列出維他命C為配方成分之一。維他命C參與膠原蛋白形成，也有助人體吸收植物性食物中的鐵。如對成分或服用有疑問，建議先諮詢醫生或其他合資格的醫護專業人士。<a href=\"https://ods.od.nih.gov/factsheets/VitaminC-Consumer/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">美國國立衞生研究院維他命C資料</a></p>\n<p>計算方法：（較高標價－較低標價）÷較高標價×100%。本次以（HK$369－HK$168）÷HK$369×100%計，約54%。上述比例未計運費及額外活動，亦不代表全港最低價、歷史低價或不同包裝版本的配方已完全核實一致。</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179453425683752160_17661593186af66b7135475.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Swisse Ultivite女性多元維他命120片裝格價：龍豐 HK$168，單瓶約平54%\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179453425683752160_17661593186af66b7135475.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a></p>\n<p>\n</p>\n<p>點樣先可以用圖中價格買到Swisse Ultivite女性多元維他命120片裝？<i></i></p>\n<p>以2026年11月13日網上報價，龍豐的單瓶商品總額為HK$168。條件為單瓶標價，未計運費。</p>\n<p>今次格價比較哪一款包裝？<i></i></p>\n<p>本次比較女性版120片裝。品牌列明配方含多種維他命、礦物質及草本成分。懷孕、授乳或正服藥的人士，選購前宜讓醫生或藥劑師查閱成分表。</p>\n</body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-13T01:53:46.646073+00:00","quality":{"score":2,"chars":825,"images":1,"source":"WeekendHK","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-13T01:44:19+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-13T02:37:21.864431+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-13T01:47:09.385173+00:00","content_hash":"635b163ca70714b0eedfe6bb6ccce75bf97617851a5e7319b8ca6ce4079a2a4b","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}